every measure. When I play it, I extend chord voicings to 7s,9s, and 13s. I also
turn the Am into an A7 one beat before it goes to a Dm. These are all totally
optional things. I included them in parenthesis, so if you just want standard
chords, ignore everything in parenthesis.

